<title>SWITZERLAND: ABB heads China power project.</title>
<headline>ABB heads China power project.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electrical engineering group ABB Asea Brown Boveri AG said it was leading a consortium that won a $650 million order for a 700 megawatt coal-fired power plant in China.</p>
</text>
